{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>方法</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>object.method()</p><p><br></p><p>Rust 的方法往往跟结构体、枚举、特征(Trait)一起使用</p>","expand":true,"uid":"7d8dbdd2-9d1c-4539-be64-65fd91ea09b4","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{"smm_img_key_3566093f-c08d-4bbf-abea-5f9c18ab85da":"data:image/png;base64,"},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>定义方法</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"0dbe6e32-5468-4946-8d38-affd0eb7e857","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>impl</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"10c49a55-c25a-47d0-9137-258be72e608c"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>struct Circle{</p><p> //定义结构体计算圆周长</p><p> private x:f64, //8字节</p><p> y:f64,</p><p> radius:f64,</p><p>}</p><p>//声明结构体内部属性</p><p>//impl 关键字定义方法</p><p>impl Circle{</p><p> /// new 结构体的实例。必须要，rust没有魔法（默认new不类似java）</p><p> fn new(x:f64,y:f64,radius:f64,)-&gt;Circle{</p><p> Circle{x,y,radius}</p><p> //字面量（literal）就是代码里直接写出来的、固定不变的值——你写它是什么，它就是什么</p><p> }</p><p><br></p><p> fn circumference(&amp;self) -&gt; f64 {</p><p> 2.0 * std::f64::consts::PI * self.radius</p><p> }</p><p> </p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>fn main() {</p><p> let c = Circle::new(0.0, 0.0, 5.0); // 关联函数调用</p><p> println!(\"周长: {}\", c.circumference()); // 方法调用</p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>// fn new(x:f64,y:f64,radius:f64,)-&gt;Circle{</p><p>// Circle 返回值类型 result</p><p><br></p><p>//self 表示调用这个方法的结构体实例本身（类似 Python 的 self、Java/C++ 的 this）</p><p>//&amp; 表示借用（不可变引用）——方法只是读取实例的数据，不修改它，也不拿走所有权</p><p>//正因为有 self 参数，它才叫方法（可以用 . 调用，比如 c.circumference()）；没有 self 的叫关联函数（用 :: 调用，比如 Circle::new(...)）</p><p><br></p>","uid":"67d8fb02-f9f6-434b-92c5-84f004d73ac1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>和其他语言对比</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b5e90e6e-3397-4f65-bfd9-19c0dda82f82"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p><br></p>","uid":"3f2a1b76-4328-47d7-bf25-7daaf9ac0746","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_3566093f-c08d-4bbf-abea-5f9c18ab85da","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":488.2661719734852,"height":431.2499523162841,"custom":true}},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>其它语言中所有定义都在 class 中</p><p>Rust 的对象定义和方法定义是分离的</p>","uid":"01d063db-4496-4d67-bdf8-009e72570e4c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>方法名跟结构体字段名相同</p><p>在 Rust 中，允许方法名跟结构体的字段名相同</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"2a72eae7-a2f8-4065-8331-c84ddb208803"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>impl Rectangle {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;fn width(&amp;self) -&gt; bool {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;self.width &gt; 0</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let rect1 = Rectangle {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;width: 30,</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;height: 50,</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;};</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if rect1.width() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"The rectangle has a nonzero width; it is {}\", rect1.width);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>}</p>","uid":"60bd3218-dd1c-4b5c-9008-84cbb77bbce8","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>模块外部怎么访问结构体内部私有属性</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"c7390276-d350-4e56-b1c3-988439b03782"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>mod my {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pub struct Rectangle {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;width: u32,</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pub height: u32,</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;impl Rectangle {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pub fn new(width: u32, height: u32) -&gt; Self {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rectangle { width, height }</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pub fn width(&amp;self) -&gt; u32 {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return self.width;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pub fn height(&amp;self) -&gt; u32 {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return self.height;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let rect1 = my::Rectangle::new(30, 50);</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"{}\", rect1.width()); // OK</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"{}\", rect1.height()); // OK</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// println!(\"{}\", rect1.width); // Error - the visibility of field defaults to private</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"{}\", rect1.height); // OK</p><p>}</p>","uid":"bd3bf5de-ab52-4820-be9d-c93a947ca1fa","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>当从模块外部访问结构体时，结构体的字段默认是私有的，其目的是隐藏信息（封装）。我们如果想要从模块外部获取 Rectangle 的字段，只需把它的 new， width 和 height 方法设置为公开可见，那么用户就可以创建一个矩形，同时通过访问器 rect1.width() 和 rect1.height() 方法来获取矩形的宽度和高度。</p>","uid":"4fc2398d-711f-40f5-8019-43365ff8d2ed","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>多参数方法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"469f8264-e0aa-4ff9-b89b-f1322a173338"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>关联函数</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"c69086bd-a8da-47bb-ae95-ad6c57f40ac3"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>neum实现方法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"07812f00-4604-41dd-b4df-0c7e00481087"},"children":[]}]},"theme":{"template":"classic4","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":0.6400000000000001,"scaleY":0.6400000000000001,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-612.8000000000001,"translateY":-452,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":0.6400000000000001,"b":0,"c":0,"d":0.6400000000000001,"e":-612.8000000000001,"f":-452},"state":{"scale":0.6400000000000001,"x":-603.8207001260612,"y":-443.7999542236332,"sx":-603.8207001260612,"sy":-311.7999542236332}}}